			rgCommunityRecommendations: [{"appid":2445260,"reviews":[{"recommendationid":"234767811","appid":2445260,"accountid":452749461,"playtime_at_review":776,"review_text":"Scratches the Tanki Online itch I've had since I was a kid. Also, one of the best features this game has (that I haven't seen any other game do so far) is that, if you die before the battle ends, you can leave the battle and...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198413015189\/recommended\/2445260\/","votes_up":7},{"recommendationid":"234770594","appid":2445260,"accountid":123433287,"playtime_at_review":1538,"review_text":"Tyr, is a phenomenal game, it fixes every problem I had with WoT. The games dont become slow stone walled slogs waiting for someone to get bored and rush, Something will always happen to keep the game moving. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198083699015\/recommended\/2445260\/","votes_up":3}]},{"appid":2075800,"reviews":[{"recommendationid":"234761951","appid":2075800,"accountid":414763452,"playtime_at_review":2601,"review_text":"I usually dont like turn based games AT ALL, honestly i find them pretty boring most of the time, so i really wasnt expecting to get this addicted to this game!! ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198375029180\/recommended\/2075800\/","votes_up":60}]},{"appid":3669570,"reviews":[{"recommendationid":"234789768","appid":3669570,"accountid":61573021,"playtime_at_review":240,"review_text":"Some things of note. This is one of those fantasy shop games that runs off an asset store template. You know them when you see it. That said, the store part is just for off-loading resources, the actual game is a rather well...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198021838749\/recommended\/3669570\/","votes_up":5},{"recommendationid":"234781634","appid":3669570,"accountid":38977293,"playtime_at_review":1973,"review_text":"Just amazing. A mix of a cute scale Satisfactory and a shop keeper game. There's no pressure, take as much time as you need, spend 10 hours crafting your perfect blueprint, disappear from your customers for days, no one...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561197999243021\/recommended\/3669570\/","votes_up":2}]},{"appid":4047270,"reviews":[{"recommendationid":"234789715","appid":4047270,"accountid":8009001,"playtime_at_review":122,"review_text":"Really enjoying this so far. The art style is super neat, the army building has more going on than I expected, and this thing is... well it's addictive as hell. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561197968274729\/recommended\/4047270\/","votes_up":11}]},{"appid":3219630,"reviews":[{"recommendationid":"234759271","appid":3219630,"accountid":414676207,"playtime_at_review":625,"review_text":"Great game with an awesome atmosphere and a really fun community!! It actually reminds me a lot of Friday the 13th, the matches are fun. Really happy to see a game like this!! \ud83e\udd79","review_text_truncated":false,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198374941935\/recommended\/3219630\/","votes_up":46},{"recommendationid":"234795373","appid":3219630,"accountid":894662641,"playtime_at_review":839,"review_text":"Nice day 1 patch but pls fix the performance, especially in story mode. Also, when you play as civilians, you guys need to remember that the goal isn't exactly for your character to escape, the goal is to get NPC's out as...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198854928369\/recommended\/3219630\/","votes_up":3},{"recommendationid":"234797806","appid":3219630,"accountid":311239782,"playtime_at_review":1077,"review_text":"This is genuinely the most fun I've had on an asymmetrical horror since Friday the 13th. It doesn't take itself too seriously and the community is hilarious.","review_text_truncated":false,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198271505510\/recommended\/3219630\/","votes_up":2},{"recommendationid":"234788180","appid":3219630,"accountid":106348442,"playtime_at_review":1158,"review_text":"Its been a fun game so far. Played as both civilians and Michael and both are fun. Its more than just an escape the killer type of game. I think anyone who enjoys this genre would enjoy the game.","review_text_truncated":false,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198066614170\/recommended\/3219630\/","votes_up":2},{"recommendationid":"234804855","appid":3219630,"accountid":20974388,"playtime_at_review":253,"review_text":"Reminds me of the early days of Friday the 13th. Its a lot of fun. Great Graphics-Great Atmosphere-Great Audio\/Soundtrack. I haven't encountered a lot of bugs but there are some . ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561197981240116\/recommended\/3219630\/","votes_up":2}]},{"appid":3375110,"reviews":[{"recommendationid":"234781808","appid":3375110,"accountid":91139955,"playtime_at_review":730,"review_text":"I feel like people don't pay attention to the updates and don't go to discussions to see if the dev's are responding to problems. A lot of the bugs they already know about, and are fixing due to people bringing them up. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198051405683\/recommended\/3375110\/","votes_up":12}]},{"appid":3751260,"reviews":[{"recommendationid":"234766361","appid":3751260,"accountid":190687107,"playtime_at_review":1468,"review_text":"Super fun game, vampires done right for sure! Needs a little work on optimization but the overall experience was fantastic.","review_text_truncated":false,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198150952835\/recommended\/3751260\/","votes_up":20},{"recommendationid":"234757404","appid":3751260,"accountid":39218024,"playtime_at_review":954,"review_text":"What a sleeper of a release. I had no idea this game was coming. I remember watching an early game development video on this from what I remember could be at least 2 years ago and was like, hey this looks cool. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561197999483752\/recommended\/3751260\/","votes_up":8},{"recommendationid":"234813877","appid":3751260,"accountid":219218334,"playtime_at_review":1499,"review_text":"I can see why many draw parallels between The Blood of Dawnwalker and The Witcher series. Whilst the game shares many similarities, such as the overall style and the music having a noticeable resemblance to The Witcher, I...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198179484062\/recommended\/3751260\/","votes_up":2},{"recommendationid":"234794550","appid":3751260,"accountid":130453686,"playtime_at_review":2734,"review_text":"I had a great time playing the game, despite the fact that it is not perfect and has its flaws. This game is basically The Witcher 3.5 where you play as a higher vampire, with a better combat system and skill tree. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198090719414\/recommended\/3751260\/","votes_up":4}]},{"appid":1510440,"reviews":[{"recommendationid":"234793485","appid":1510440,"accountid":301636698,"playtime_at_review":128,"review_text":"Ive only been able to play for a couple hours so far, but I like it! If you are a survival game veteran, the tutorial is frustrating, but the mechanics seem pretty strong and i like the aesthetics a lot. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198261902426\/recommended\/1510440\/","votes_up":27},{"recommendationid":"234798253","appid":1510440,"accountid":1107568739,"playtime_at_review":213,"review_text":"I have been playing for a few hours now and I have to say, I am quite enjoying the experience! Much like Subnautica and No Man's Sky, the scanning and utilizing of the environment is huge, but with Honeycomb, its takes more...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561199067834467\/recommended\/1510440\/","votes_up":9}]},{"appid":3624140,"reviews":[{"recommendationid":"234777711","appid":3624140,"accountid":46284706,"playtime_at_review":98,"review_text":"always wondered how mortal engine would play as a game while this is not steampunk theme it's close enough to Municipal Darwinism, \"Prepare to Ingest!\"","review_text_truncated":false,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198006550434\/recommended\/3624140\/","votes_up":26},{"recommendationid":"234770408","appid":3624140,"accountid":1558423838,"playtime_at_review":67,"review_text":"https:\/\/youtu.be\/AV83-1bophk The video is a playthrough of the first map. The game is worth it for the music alone. This is a bullet heaven game where you get to drive a castle on wheels. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561199518689566\/recommended\/3624140\/","votes_up":25}]},{"appid":2638890,"reviews":[{"recommendationid":"234798194","appid":2638890,"accountid":72415948,"playtime_at_review":2309,"review_text":"Great game! CAPCOM is in a Golden Era! So many good games, one after another! Incredible sword fights, boss battles, characters and story! Keep it going!","review_text_truncated":false,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198032681676\/recommended\/2638890\/","votes_up":6},{"recommendationid":"234765026","appid":2638890,"accountid":18662041,"playtime_at_review":1568,"review_text":"This is a good return to Onimusha. Combat is good and sets itself apart from other games of this genre. Plenty of variety with enemy types, upgrades, and unlocks. Boss fights are absolute peak. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561197978927769\/recommended\/2638890\/","votes_up":2}]},{"appid":2129530,"reviews":[{"recommendationid":"234757863","appid":2129530,"accountid":40278372,"playtime_at_review":411,"review_text":"This is what Little Nightmares 3 should have been. Dark, edgy, intensely atmospheric. Only it's very short. My total playtime was 7 hours and that included DLC and troubleshooting.","review_text_truncated":false,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198000544100\/recommended\/2129530\/","votes_up":6}]},{"appid":3748520,"reviews":[{"recommendationid":"234788932","appid":3748520,"accountid":74032147,"playtime_at_review":90,"review_text":"A blast to play, runs beautifully, and feels kinda like a PC gamer's take on early 2000's console shooters. 100% recommended for anyone who loves single player first person shooters.","review_text_truncated":false,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198034297875\/recommended\/3748520\/","votes_up":8}]}],
